      "body": "\n\n## Overview\n\nOn SM100, block-FP8 GEMMs with 33-64 tokens use the swapAB kernel with a 16-wide token tile, which re-reads the weights every 16 tokens. This uses a 32-wide tile for that range. M <= 32 and M > 64 are unchanged.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Decode on `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8`, 1xB200: 1.36x faster step at batch 64, 1.11x at batch 48.\n- `cutlass_scaled_mm` 1.05-1.83x faster at M 33-64 on the model's GEMM shapes, with identical output.\n\n## Validation\n\n```text\npytest tests/kernels/quantization/test_block_fp8.py -k cutlass -> 7 passed (adds M=33, 64)\n```\n\n`LLM.generate`, 128 input tokens, step = (T(out=128) - T(out=1)) / 127. main / PR / PR / main runs, spread < 0.05 ms. Kernel times: CUPTI, CUDA graph, cold L2, 2 rounds per tree.\n\n| Qwen3.8-27B-FP8, 1xB200 | main | PR |\n|---|---|---|\n| decode step bs1 / 32 | 9.36 / 11.75 ms | 9.35 / 11.74 ms |\n| decode step bs48 / 64 | 13.91 / 18.47 ms | **12.52 / 13.56 ms** |\n| gemm M=64: qkv / o / gate_up / down (us) | 37.1 / 24.4 / 68.4 / 58.3 | 24.0 / 14.7 / 43.3 / 31.9 |\n\n## Details\n\nSM103 shares this dispatch but was not measured.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Minimizes impact on core components, reuses existing functionality, and justifies added complexity.\n- [x] **Testing and Validation:** Validates the change and ensures any added tests are meaningful and reliable, with CI coverage or documented CI resource constraints and validation performed outside CI.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Keeps code and comments clear and concise, and updates relevant documentation and examples.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes a brief summary and relevant links, supports claims with evidence, explains root causes and implementation trade-offs, and follows the contributing guide.\n</details>\n\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63516?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795468995&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63516&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63516&signature=959c1a49ba92abb21b3ddd29ab88f91db5a76a7804b7f9cb309871c3c6b2fe81\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63516?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith